      "id": "claim_2a124938020d4e848c1a1884af328de5",
      "statement": "The NII Sensitivity workbook enforces Board limits (NII decline no more than 7.0% of base NII in any parallel shock; EVE decline no more than 15.0% of Tier 1 capital) with BREACH/Within limit status cells; known limitations are parallel shocks only, static balance sheet, and constant deposit betas, compensated by a quarterly dynamic simulation, and deposit betas come from an annually calibrated, MRGR-approved Deposit Behaviour sub-model.",
